guile-openapi-generator (0.1.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * New upstream release.
  * Install the launcher as /usr/bin/guile-openapi-generator, so the package
    ships the command its documentation describes and not only modules.
  * Install the new manual page.
  * Run the suites with the Veritas environment they expect, and with
    guile-curl available so the libcurl transport test really runs.
  * Install the program through scripts/install-tree, the installer the Arch,
    openSUSE and container recipes run as well, instead of a second copy of the
    layout here.
  * Add an autopkgtest that exercises the installed command end to end, and a
    second one that checks the installed layout and its byte-compiled cache.
  * Add a watch file, so uscan can find the release tags.

 -- Josep Bigorra <jjbigorra@gmail.com>  Sat, 31 Oct 2026 12:00:00 +0100

